      519.99,
      549.69,
      573.06
    ],
    "text": "NOTICE is hereby given in terms of Section 84 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Law No. 02 of 1974 that, water charges of the \u201cPort City\u201d category consumers (Category No. 78) supplied with water through the water supply schemes of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board consolidated with the commercial category and the following tari\ufb00 will be revised with e\ufb00 ect from the 09th day of September, 2025.",
